<title>CHINA: China interbank market rates (CHIBOR) most down.</title>
<headline>China interbank market rates (CHIBOR) most down.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the China Interbank Offered Rate (CHIBOR) for Friday issued by the official Xinhua news agency on behalf of the People's Bank of China, the central bank. The figures represent weighted averages and not closing prices and are annual percentage rates.</p>
<p>		 1DAY   7DAY  20DAY  30DAY  60DAY  90DAY  120DAY</p>
<p> FRIDAY     11.977 12.135   -    11.295 11.521 11.889 12.083</p>
<p> THURSDAY   11.695 11.479 11.930 11.549 11.638 11.971 12.600</p>
<p>Turnover fell to 3.6 billion yuan from 4.3 billion yuan on Thursday with the 60-day contract the most active.</p>
</text>
